# PartnerOS frontend environment variables (Vite, client-side only).
#
# TEST / PREVIEW (Lovable preview, localhost) -> project ref avxxzmoayxzrykwqzoqn
# All VITE_* values below MUST belong to the TEST project.
VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID="avxxzmoayxzrykwqzoqn"
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://avxxzmoayxzrykwqzoqn.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="<test-project-publishable-anon-key>"
#
# PRODUCTION (https://partneros.manwinwin.com) is configured in Vercel only.
# Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables (Production scope) must set:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL              = https://qownzparzsaeoyccgwuj.supabase.co
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY  = <prod project publishable/anon key>
#   VITE_SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID       = qownzparzsaeoyccgwuj
#
# The runtime guard in src/lib/supabase-env.ts fails closed if the production
# host resolves to anything other than project ref qownzparzsaeoyccgwuj.
#
# NEVER put a service_role key or any other secret in this file or in any VITE_* variable.
